        "TileImage": "$($repository f0041173-59d1-4e97-8a2e-44e104ca4202).Image",
        "Description": "Looks like a trace of the virus escaped Sapienza (Thanks a lot Craig...) and Nabazov wants you to end it and jeff in Hokkaido.\r\rYui - Will surely be infected by Cage and spread the virus. Kill her before she has the chance to make contact with anyone without a bio suit.\r\rCage - Virus host. Incinerate him to leave nothing left.\r\rJeff - You know why. Make sure he&apos;s reduced to a red splotch on the mountain face.\r\rAmos - Another Immortal who needs to be killed.\r\rDO NOT SPREAD THE VIRUS WEAR BIO SUIT",
